    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Quarantines and lockdowns caused by the COVID-19 pandemic pose many challenges for parents and caregivers of children under the age of 5. Disruptions to the education system and key preventive health services are especially concerning for those under the age of 5 since this stage is one of great physical, cognitive and socio-emotional development.",
